From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: At30c <PabloAtsoc9993@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 21:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] knoxpatch: test bypass for Knox key installability gate

Return success before the framework preflight invokes Keymaster attestation
for KnoxTestKey. This is intentionally a diagnostic patch: it does not alter
VaultKeeper, the TEE, or any hardware-backed key operation. If provisioning
still fails later, the remaining failure is below the framework layer.
---
 .../server/knox/dar/DarManagerService.smali        | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/com/android/server/knox/dar/DarManagerService.smali b/smali/com/android/server/knox/dar/DarManagerService.smali
index e507b8f7..00000000 100644
--- a/smali/com/android/server/knox/dar/DarManagerService.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/server/knox/dar/DarManagerService.smali
@@ -1708,6 +1708,10 @@
 .end method
 
 .method public final isKnoxKeyInstallable()Z
     .locals 17
 
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
+
+    return v0
+
     move-object/from16 v1, p0
 
     const-string v0, "EC"
-- 
2.53.0
